 characters within a troubled world that is sure to delight people of all ages looking for a strong narrative and puzzle experience!\nSo, what have we got in store for you?\n\nA graphic adventure, you will be taken back to a more troubled time, in a story that appeals to all, regardless of age or species.\n\nWith an adorable style, it's sure to whet the appetite of many a Studio Ghibli and The Last Airbender fan.\n\nTest your intellect with mind-bending puzzles and brainteasers.\n\nCute and colourful characters that will melt your heart. And some that might freeze it!\n\nAn immersive story of friendship and fate in a fantastical world.\n\nCollect an array of crazy items, each one wackier (and more useful) than the last.\n\nBeautiful original music that will transport you to the sands of Shirin.", "summary": "Nairi is a cute graphic adventure with adorable visuals, yet compelling characters within a darkly troubled world that is sure to delight anyone looking for a strong narrative and puzzle experience.", "themes": [{"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nairi-tower-of-shirin", "videos": [{"id": 18676, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "kXODC8wdvow", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kXODC8wdvow", "title": "NAIRI: Tower of Shirin - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kXODC8wdvow/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 23380, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ZxQK17o-q7Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZxQK17o-q7Y", "title": "NAIRI: Tower of Shirin Windows PC Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZxQK17o-q7Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}